<title>USA: American Stock Exchange says promotes four people.</title>
<headline>American Stock Exchange says promotes four people.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said Tuesday it promoted several staff members within its derivatives securities division.</p>
<p>AMEX said Richard Mikaliunas was promoted to senior vice president, capital markets.</p>
<p>James Baker was promoted to vice president, derivative markets.</p>
<p>Claire McGrath was promoted to vice president and special counsel, derivative securities division.</p>
<p>Clifford Weber was promoted to vice president, new prodcut development.</p>
<p>An AMEX spokeswoman said these positions are new titles.</p>
</text>
